set up mode local in 6 steps:
  1. create the token file /Users/user_name/.config/wt-model/server.token (32 random bytes, base64, mode 0600)
  2. set wt-model's LiteLLM pair in /Users/user_name/.config/wt-model/: url http://localhost:4000, key LITELLM_MASTER_KEY read from /Users/user_name/Library/LaunchAgents/local.litellm.proxy.plist when applied
  3. write wt's LaunchAgent plist /Users/user_name/Library/LaunchAgents/local.wt-model.serve.plist: /Users/user_name/.local/bin/wt-model serve --listen 127.0.0.1:8787 --token-file /Users/user_name/.config/wt-model/server.token, PATH=/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/bin:/bin, logs /Users/user_name/.wt-model.log and /Users/user_name/.wt-model.err.log, started at login and kept alive
  4. load the LaunchAgent: launchctl bootstrap gui/501 /Users/user_name/Library/LaunchAgents/local.wt-model.serve.plist
  5. wait for wt-model to answer at http://127.0.0.1:8787
  6. create [model-server] in /Users/user_name/.config/agent-wt/config.toml: mode = "local", url = "http://127.0.0.1:8787", token_file = "/Users/user_name/.config/wt-model/server.token"
